description = Color(After being laid off by an interplanetary megacorp, [PAWN_nameDef] spent several years disillusioned and fighting alcohol addiction.\n\n[PAWN_pronoun] ended up busking aboard a space freighter, playing a beaten-up guitar and entertaining the crew with blues and folk songs from the distant past., 1.0)
